{"version":1,"content":"<p>社交媒體流傳的視頻顯示：黃仁勳復職CEO首日，英偉達員工爆發出熱烈掌聲迎接他，現場有人高呼他的名字，還有一名女員工上前緊緊擁抱他。在特朗普總統介入推動下，黃仁勳戲劇性回歸。視頻裏，他身處加州聖克拉拉英偉達總部大廳，被一眾員工簇擁，大家紛紛向他表達支持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587800.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:04:08.414465+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:36:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.446417+00:00","content_hash":"485c3477cdd58d44c873b1d4a5efddecf045665d5fee8fea8feed3dc42086a9d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}